  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS MAL/2025/01-MALDIVES WETLANDS DEVELOPMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to enhance the ecological and climate resilience of Neykurendhoo&apos;s mangrove ecosystem through targeted restoration and communitybased recovery of Bruguiera cylindrica and other suitable mangrove species. This project aims to assess and support the natural regeneration of mangroves in Neykurendhoo Island, the largest mangrove island in the Maldives, which suffered complete loss of B. cylindrica during the 20202021 dieback event</narrative>
  </description>
